WEBVTT

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:37.370
Thanks to my suggestion, the Megafauna
ended up going to the Capital Territory.

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:41.450
Though we were attacked by
the Army there as well,

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:45.460
we were saved by the Capital Guard
and I even got to meet His Holiness,

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.840
but then I got taken away
by Lieutenant Kerbes.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.520
Go ahead.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.030
Your Holiness, is something the matter?

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:22.450
Th-There's something I'm thinking about...

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:28.880
We haven't met since the Mettabal
Conference, have we, Colonel?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:35.800
During the dispute over the Amerian Army
building Mobile Suits and a space fleet.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.180
At that time, it became public knowledge

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:43.680
that there is a space colony called Towasanga
on the far side of the moon.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.140
That was why people stopped
abiding by the taboo,

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.650
and why you planned to take
His Holiness hostage

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:54.190
and go up to Sankt Porto
in your pirate ship, right?

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.030
Your imagination has
gotten the better of you.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.740
The way I understand it—

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.490
Pardon me.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.490
Is it true about this fleet?

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.410
I'm supposed to be off for the weekend,

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:09.170
but Commander Jugan is calling me in.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.090
I want to go to Noredo's house!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.170
Looks like we won't be able to.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.680
No!

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:25.600
The Capital Army wants the Megafauna,
the G-Self, and that Raraiya girl as well.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.810
Why?

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:30.190
They must think she knows something
about the threat in space.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.650
After all, she's a girl who fell from the sky!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:42.320
I don't want the Army finding
us, so fly as low as possible.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.950
Yeah, we know!

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.420
Here, I'll hold you.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.930
This Wuxia is not the only one.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:05.640
We are always developing new suits.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:10.770
Senators, I hope for your continued
understanding in this—

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.610
- ﻿I'm not done yet!
- ﻿It is just as the prime minister has said!

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.230
Regardless of the situation,

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:21.320
the Capital Army must be prepared
to act at a moment's notice.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.030
A fine speech.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.280
Oh, not really...

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.320
Though it has not been long
since our establishment,

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.290
﻿To get the senate to approve funding,
we need to keep on winning.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.830
We are the greatest force
in the history of all mankind!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.210
I understand that.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.370
We've managed to procure a spaceship.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.670
Please, do not worry.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.710
Thank you for your efforts, Colonel.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.800
The one I have my eye on is...

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.340
Ah, over there!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.510
What?!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.970
That new Mobile Suit model?

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.090
The Wuxia...

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.060
It's like an old knight in shining armor!

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:49.310
Oh, I so get that!

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:59.780
You've really packed stuff in here.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:02.990
I thank you for your work, Lieutenant.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.450
I didn't do anything so special
that you need to curtsy to me.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.540
<i>﻿So she actually can say thank you...</i>

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.330
You must at least—

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:15.500
You must at least let me thank you
for bringing back the director.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.340
The Capital Guard working in space

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:21.920
have guaranteed that the Megafauna
can go out into space.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.420
That's good.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:28.140
But the Capital Army have
become aware of our presence.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.770
It looks like it's true that
there's a threat up in space.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:34.100
Huh? Did the SU-Cordist pope say that?

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.190
Noredo's house...

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.360
No. no.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.020
No, no.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:45.110
Miss Aida, I'd like you
to escort the Megafauna.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.620
Do you only let me pilot when
there's no one else available?

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.540
The Inspector General is watching!

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:52.540
He's not here right now.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.080
I left him with the director.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.000
You left him with the director?

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.750
She's Bellri's mother.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:01.840
- ﻿All hands, prepare to lift off!
- ﻿Roger!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.090
The Arcane is my unit,

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.840
so ensure that it's armed properly.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.600
No wonder they say she's always
charging ahead without thinking.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.940
Huh? Where did you put the G-Self?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.940
It's right here!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.360
I'll be busy here a bit longer. Go get ready.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.280
I'd like to get ready.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:24.690
But what exactly am I supposed
to do without the G-Self—

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:28.110
Hey! We took this one from the Capital Army.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.320
What did you take?

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.160
This High Torque Pack for land combat.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.410
What?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.710
When I see the G-Self and
this High Torque Pack,

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.750
I feel I'm starting to understand the
Rose of Hermes Blueprints' G-type.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.920
I'm getting so excited!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:48.260
While manufacturing the Wuxia,
they made this at the same time.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.720
- But it won't work with the Wuxia.
- ﻿Huh?!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.510
So I thought about this thing.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:56.940
You use a lot of backpacks, right?

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:59.480
This isn't a game, Instructor.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:03.020
I'm not your instructor anymore.
We're comrades in arms!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:08.990
I can speak to the president and ask him
to cancel the launch of the space fleet.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.490
It takes a little over one hour to
reach Capital Tower's Under Nut.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.080
If you use an atmospheric
entry glider from there,

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.080
you can return to your country in no time.

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:19.710
Will you loan me one?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.460
it borders on violating the
taboo, so it will be expensive.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.880
It's herbal tea.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.800
I quite like the fragrance.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.090
We have little choice.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.510
It is to protect Capital Tower's safety.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:36.350
This is splendid.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:38.950
Oh.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.770
On the last trip of the day,

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.690
I will go up to Sankt Porto.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:47.400
Are you sure? It takes a week.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.860
I do it every year.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.320
Well then, will you go as well?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.700
Yes. tell the Megafauna—

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.410
We can make land line calls from here.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.830
I'll make the call.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.210
These are scrumptious.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:09.630
They call them the Capital Army,
but they're still a bunch of amateurs.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.300
That still doesn't mean we
can let our guard down!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.390
R-Roger that, Miss Aida!

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:18.520
Even I...

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.600
have things I can't do!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.110
You just need to go at it with the same
energy that the Capital Guard has!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.950
Hey! Hold up!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.160
Not again!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.280
- Put her to bed!
- ﻿Raraiya!

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.580
Launch. G-Self! Launch!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.830
Hey!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.620
Honestly...

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.630
That girl...

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.550
And what's with Bellri?

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.220
Come on, Chuchumy says you should sleep.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.720
She can't sleep?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.510
Well, she suddenly started shouting.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.560
She was shouting about
the G-Self, wasn't she?

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:03.270
Yeah. We can just leave the G-Self to Bellri.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.440
What's the matter?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.570
Raraiya is—

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:12.110
Sorry.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.200
What happened to the G-Self?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.120
Ask the lieutenant!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.620
That girl...

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.040
She's changing?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.960
Incoming! Incoming! Incoming!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.630
Are they from the Capital Guard?

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:29.090
Mobile Suits, get into position to intercept.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:33.550
The Recksnows that met us are piloted by
Capital Guard members who are on our side.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.510
They're wearing headbands.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.100
Don't mistake them for the enemy.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:41.140
Lieutenant Kerbes, will you be
protecting this ship as well?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.430
I'm not just doing it because
of the director's orders.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:46.690
I'm somewhat interested
in the Megafauna myself.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.820
- Oh, you're one of those warship lovers.
- ﻿Did you just mock me?

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.440
It's reassuring to have you with us.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.700
We really are grateful, Director.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:10:00.240
Yes. I'll be hanging up now.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.370
Later.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:05.040
What's going on with the G-Self?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:09.130
The Capital Army's G-type backpack is
being a pain in the butt to adjust.

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:11.000
Just make it usable.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.380
- But...!
- What is Bellri doing?

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:16.470
I'm crying! There's no point
in me even being here!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.470
The Wuxia of the Becker Unit,

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.520
in order to eliminate the space pirates,

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:24.890
will now...

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.020
You idiot!

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.060
- Huh?
- Capture the G-Self!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:35.030
Taking Raraiya Monday and Bellri Zenam under
our protection is the goal of this operation!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:38.410
Catsith Unit, give those
Wuxia your steady support!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:46.540
We'll show them how nimble
the Wuxia's fingers are!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.550
They're wonderful.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.220
Oh, the world of men!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:02.010
Go, go, Wuxia! Take out that pirate ship!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.470
Women...

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:05.770
Yes, it's me.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:08.230
You can get in contact with Mask, right?

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.060
Yes, I'll be going to meet you.

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:46.770
We're right below Capital Tower.
Don't start anything yourselves.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:52.110
If the Catsiths and Doubeys can separate
the Megafauna from the Mobile Suits...

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:59.240
Why are there Recs on the pirate ship?

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:03.620
Miss Aida's saying "I can't just
leave this to the Capital Guard!"

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.120
That darned tomboy!

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.920
We'll board the Megafauna with our Wuxia!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.010
If the Catsiths are like aircraft

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:21.010
then we have the agility of spacecraft!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.890
With a simple jump!

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.680
The bridge...!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.770
G-G-Self?! No, it's not!

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:38.440
The Capital Army is using that many
Mobile Suits on the ground...

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.160
They must be insane!

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:44.320
But I can tell it's a G-type Mobile Suit!

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:56.960
Where are Bellri and Raraiya
aboard the pirate ship?

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.670
I'll threaten the bridge and drag them out!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.600
Pirate ship captain, do you hear me?

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:10.600
Hand over the G-Self, Bellri
Zenam, and Raraiya Monday!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.390
Cease your resistance as well!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:17.610
How are we supposed to contact them
when you've spread Minovsky Particles?

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.780
Try stopping them by force!

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.610
What?

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.490
What's your problem?

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.950
I'm trying to have a conversation here.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.450
So back off!

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:36.920
What does he want Raraiya for?

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.170
Heck if I know.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:42.090
The Capital Territory folks seem concerned
about her, so you should be too!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:42.970
Right...

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:46.680
Come on, they'll put a hole in your body.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.640
Beam rifle combat?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.060
For that girl. Normal Suit.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.850
- For that girl.
- A Normal Suit!

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:01.990
Those are Wuxia!

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:05.070
The army must have put them
into service at some point!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.170
The Megafauna will get shot down!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.000
Not again.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.500
What are you plotting?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:22.510
I'm ordering you to turn
over Bellri and Raraiya!

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:24.220
He's gonna—!

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.090
Stop that!

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:34.480
That's Miss Aida's foot!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:38.230
Mr. Happa! No matter how
powerful that backpack is,

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.070
if I can't use it, it's worthless!

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.860
Don't tell me things I already know!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:45.360
If we can't protect the
Megafauna, we'll die too!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.080
Miss Aida, you shouldn't
do anything reckless!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:54.080
- Are you in love with her?
- ﻿That's not what this is about!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.380
This machine is similar to the G-Self.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:01.920
I must know more!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:09.640
Mr. Happa!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.470
The output's gone up!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.230
- It's gonna work!
- ﻿Okay!

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:27.110
Don't be in such a rush to get
out there that you get killed!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:30.370
I've found love! I'm not gonna die!

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.540
Put the hover on to land!

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:44.760
Where is Miss Aida?

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:02.520
This is fun! This thing is good!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.530
This Wuxia the Capital Army developed...

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:06.990
I'm in love!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.330
Not enough horsepower.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.160
What?

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:26.760
Here it comes!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.980
You too!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.610
It shouldn't explode like that.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:47.900
Where is Miss Aida?

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.450
There she is!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:55.330
Miss Aida's been caught!

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.290
Something's trying to sneak into the jungle!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.160
It's stronger than me!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.750
Everyone is fighting.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.630
I'll have to do this myself!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:25.560
Are you mocking me?!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.280
What?!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:38.540
Get lost!

00:17:58.350 --> 00:18:00.470
You came up with that idea on your own?

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:03.100
W-Well, you were...

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.850
The Capital Army?

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.110
Capital Tower is just ahead of us!

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:10.900
Go back!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.410
I'm... I'm sinking!

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:16.420
I'm sinking!
I'm... I'm sinking!

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:18.160
I'm sinking!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.370
Someone help!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:30.210
Don't come any closer!
Save me without getting any closer!

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:36.010
I'm impressed you didn't
get caught in the bog.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:40.140
The sensors in my legs are sensitive.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.850
It seems they can detect the
firmness of the terrain.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:43.930
Brace for Gs.

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:46.230
My wings were broken.

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:47.900
I've prepared myself for it.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.400
Well then, we'll head back to the Megafauna.

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:10.170
There are people from the Capital
Guard on the Megafauna as well.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:14.590
Yeah. They must have issues with
the way the Capital Army operates.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.680
My mother will forgive
me for going back there.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.690
G-Self and Arcane have returned!

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:33.110
You should be using the front deck.

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.440
I know!

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:40.280
No!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.160
Oh, shoot! Luan is mad!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.040
Bell, take those two inside.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.630
Raraiya's come out on the
deck and is doing something.

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.850
Raraiya Monday, huh?

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:09.980
Thanks to this backpack,

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.440
I was able to live a little longer.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:14.190
But is it really...

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.070
...okay for these things to exist?

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:22.570
When His Holiness says he fears
not what will come from space,

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:25.910
but the people on Earth,
that resonates with me.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.460
I must keep things on schedule,
so if you'll excuse me...

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.960
See to it that the inspector
general makes it home safely.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.000
Yes Ma'am.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.590
Thank you.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:39.470
About the news from the Amerian
government broadcast...

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:40.800
Government broadcast?

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:48.100
The president is launching our space fleet?

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.270
When did you come on board?

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.820
I was in a hurry to get here,

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:00.650
so I jumped into the last luggage car.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:03.160
And what business does a colonel from
the Research Division have here?

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:07.200
I was the one who procured
the Garanden from Gondwan.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.290
It's my responsibility to oversee its work.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.580
A taxing job, I'm sure.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.500
We will be launching on schedule.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.670
I will be resting.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:21.760
Yes, please do relax.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:37.610
MMF regular operation. Launch.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:56.170
Fill any place there might
be an air leak with packing.

00:21:56.170 --> 00:22:00.420
We'll have the Mobile Suits
do the work humans can't!

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:14.480
Okay!

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:18.190
This ship, the Space Garanden,
will enter geocentric orbit.

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:20.280
Then, after we rendezvous with Captain Mask,

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:23.450
we will begin operations to prevent
the Amerian Army's attack.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:03.000
When you're aboard the Megafauna,

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.790
there's no way to tell what's
going to happen in the world.

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:08.250
Having gone all the way
up to satellite orbit,

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:10.880
I was attacked by a doll-like Mobile Suit.

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:13.170
I ended up having to fling
myself at the enemy,

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:14.720
and I nearly died!

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:17.470
That masked man is insane!

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:20.560
Next time on Reconguista in G,

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:23.020
Charge in! The Space War.

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:25.560
The Earth is under your feet!
